license: "PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  This repository contains the computational framework and analytical models for 
  studying spectral confinement in Ring-LWE lattices. It provides the formal 
  derivation of the violation of the Eigenstate Thermalization Hypothesis (ETH) 
  through the identification of the Gaussian primorial Pi_2 as a parsimony 
  attractor. The work includes the calculation of the geometric renormalization 
  constant (epsilon = pi*sqrt(2G)) and the empirical confirmation of the 
  sub-extensive fractal dimension (D2 approx 0.2329) using Inverse Participation 
  Ratio (IPR) analysis on Z[i].
